SUMMARY:PEY Co-op Edge Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The U of T Engineering Career Centre invites you to join us on Saturday\, September 19th\, 2026\, for the 10th annual PEY Co-op Edge Conference! \nThis an excellent opportunity to build connections with peers\, returning senior PEY Co-op students and PEY employers to help you compete for your upcoming summer and/or PEY Co-op work-term. \n PEY Co-op Edge Conference highlights: \n\nPanel discussion with current PEY Co-op employers\n\n\nA PEY Co-op Community Lunch giving you a chance network with employers and returning PEY Co-op students.\nPoster Presentations and Work-Term Presentations from returning PEY Co-op students showcasing the projects and experiences from their summer and 12–16-month work terms.\nA Resume and Cover Letter Workshop to help prepare your application documents for the recruitment cycle.\n\nJoin us to learn how the PEY Co-op work term can influence and inform your future career goals! \nCompanies represented: \n\nAMD\nWilliams F1 Team\nIBM Canada\nMDA Space\nAirbus\nRBC\nEnvironment and Climate Change Canada (ECCC)\nOntario Power Generation\nStantec\nAECOM\nEcobee\nLedcor\nBirch Hill Equity\nGraham Construction\nHusky Technologies\nHarvard Medical School\nDufferin Aggregates\nAgnico Eagle Mines Limited\nAiredale by Modine\nUniversity of Stuttgart\nVeolia\nCanada Life\nDunlap Institute for Astronomy and Astrophysics\, University of Toronto\nAnd much more!\n\nCheck your email and/or visit the U of T Co-op Portal for registration information.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/pey-co-op-edge-conference/
LOCATION:Myhal Centre for Engineering Innovation & Entrepreneurship @ 55 St. George Street
CATEGORIES:Info sessions,Lectures, seminars and workshops,Socials
ORGANIZER;CN="Engineering Career Centre":MAILTO:events.ecc@utoronto.ca
END:VEVENT
