SUMMARY:Seattle: Skuligan Hike
DESCRIPTION: Attention U of T Engineering alumni in the Seattle area! \nYour fellow Skule™ alumna\, Katie Vranesic\, is organizing a group hike to send off the summer! Join her and other engineering alumni to connect\, share memories and reminisce. \nDogs are welcome! Katie will have her Shih Tzu puppy\, Astro (9 months) along for the walk. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, September 20\, 2026\nTime: 11:00 a.m.\nLocation: Saltwater State Park\n*RSVP to be added to the WhatsApp group with specific meet-up information\n \nRegister now!  \nQuestions? \nEmail Katie Vranesic or alumni.relations@engineering.utoronto.ca  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDiscover your Global Alumni Ambassadors (GAA) around the world—visit our GAA site for more details!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/seattle-skuligan-hike/
LOCATION:Saltwater State Park
CATEGORIES:Socials
